{"id":"vd-b1-the-dancer","level":"b1","n":21,"title":{"en":"I've Always Wanted to Dance","vi":"Con luôn muốn được nhảy"},"summary":"Sau buổi gặp thầy Kai, trên chiếc taxi về nhà, ông Rao lần đầu hỏi con trai về ước mơ thật sự của cậu.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-dancer","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Dancer","vi":"Chàng vũ công"}},"scene":{"background":"car","props":[]},"cast":{"rao":{"name":{"en":"Mr. Rao","vi":"Ông Rao"},"look":"man","x":560,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#3A3A3A","skin":"#A8704C","skinShade":"#8E5C3C","outfit":"jacket","top":"#4A4A4A","topShade":"#3A3A3A"}},"arun":{"name":{"en":"Arun","vi":"Arun"},"look":"teenboy","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#A8704C","skinShade":"#8E5C3C","outfit":"tee","top":"#E74C3C","topShade":"#CB4335"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"rao","en":"Your teacher, Kai, seems like a good man. He says you're very gifted.","vi":"Thầy Kai của con có vẻ là người tốt. Thầy ấy nói con rất có năng khiếu.","ipa":["jɔɹ","ˈtitʃɚ","kaɪ","simz","laɪk","ə","ɡʊd","mæn","hi","sɛz","jʊɹ","ˈvɛɹi","ˈɡɪftəd"],"start":0.554,"end":5.364,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.68],[2,1.253],[3,1.774],[4,2.087],[5,2.256],[6,2.334],[7,2.542],[8,3.834],[9,4.029],[10,4.354],[11,4.537],[12,4.888]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"He is, Dad. He teaches us for free.","vi":"Vâng, bố. Thầy dạy tụi con miễn phí.","ipa":["hi","ɪz","dæd","hi","ˈtitʃəz","ʌs","fɔɹ","fɹi"],"start":6.154,"end":8.654,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,6.154],[1,6.267],[2,6.684],[3,7.478],[4,7.57],[5,7.986],[6,8.129],[7,8.273]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"So tell me honestly. What do you want to do with your life?","vi":"Vậy nói thật với bố đi. Con muốn làm gì với cuộc đời mình?","ipa":["soʊ","tɛl","mi","ˈɑnəstli","wʌt","du","ju","wɑnt","tu","du","wɪð","jɔɹ","laɪf"],"start":9.444,"end":13.284,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,9.444],[1,9.604],[2,9.838],[3,10.02],[4,11.533],[5,11.767],[6,11.858],[7,12.001],[8,12.223],[9,12.327],[10,12.522],[11,12.718],[12,12.9]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"I've always wanted to dance. Since I was fourteen.","vi":"Con luôn muốn được nhảy. Từ hồi mười bốn tuổi.","ipa":["aɪv","ˈɔlˌweɪz","ˈwɔntɪd","tu","dæns","sɪns","aɪ","wɑz","ˈfɔɹˈtin"],"start":14.074,"end":16.754,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,14.074],[1,14.181],[2,14.481],[3,14.715],[4,14.767],[5,15.77],[6,15.978],[7,16.043],[8,16.213]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"And not medicine? Not at all?","vi":"Còn ngành y thì sao? Hoàn toàn không à?","ipa":["ənd","nɑt","ˈmɛdəsən","nɑt","æt","ɔl"],"start":17.544,"end":20.274,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,17.544],[1,17.674],[2,17.935],[3,19.395],[4,19.786],[5,19.929]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"I'm sorry, Dad. It was your dream, not mine.","vi":"Con xin lỗi, bố. Đó là giấc mơ của bố, không phải của con.","ipa":["aɪm","ˈsɑɹi","dæd","ɪt","wɑz","jɔɹ","dɹim","nɑt","maɪn"],"start":21.064,"end":23.994,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,21.064],[1,21.158],[2,21.51],[3,22.252],[4,22.369],[5,22.513],[6,22.643],[7,23.45],[8,23.632]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"Then what is your dream?","vi":"Vậy giấc mơ của con là gì?","ipa":["ðɛn","wʌt","ɪz","jɔɹ","dɹim"],"start":24.784,"end":26.004,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,24.784],[1,24.963],[2,25.184],[3,25.34],[4,25.483]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"My dream is to study at the dance academy and become a professional dancer.","vi":"Giấc mơ của con là học ở học viện múa và trở thành vũ công chuyên nghiệp.","ipa":["maɪ","dɹim","ɪz","tu","ˈstʌdi","æt","ðə","dæns","əˈkædəmi","ənd","bɪˈkʌm","ə","pɹəˈfɛʃənəl","ˈdænsɚ"],"start":26.794,"end":30.944,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,26.794],[1,26.963],[2,27.367],[3,27.484],[4,27.575],[5,27.966],[6,28.057],[7,28.161],[8,28.461],[9,29.307],[10,29.398],[11,29.75],[12,29.815],[13,30.401]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"That's a difficult career. Most dancers don't earn much money.","vi":"Đó là một nghề khó. Hầu hết vũ công chẳng kiếm được bao nhiêu tiền.","ipa":["ðæts","ə","ˈdɪfəkəlt","kɚˈɪɹ","moʊst","ˈdænsɚz","doʊnt","ɝn","mʌtʃ","ˈmʌni"],"start":31.734,"end":36.124,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,31.734],[1,31.985],[2,32.115],[3,32.662],[4,34.161],[5,34.539],[6,35.021],[7,35.281],[8,35.502],[9,35.737]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"I know. That's why I'm hoping to get a scholarship. Kai says I have a good chance.","vi":"Con biết. Vì vậy con đang hy vọng giành được học bổng. Thầy Kai nói con có cơ hội lớn.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","ðæts","waɪ","aɪm","ˈhoʊpɪŋ","tu","ɡɛt","ə","ˈskɑlɚˌʃɪp","kaɪ","sɛz","aɪ","hæv","ə","ɡʊd","tʃæns"],"start":36.914,"end":41.134,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,36.914],[1,36.953],[2,37.708],[3,37.865],[4,37.995],[5,38.099],[6,38.412],[7,38.49],[8,38.633],[9,38.685],[10,39.792],[11,39.922],[12,40.156],[13,40.221],[14,40.352],[15,40.417],[16,40.599]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"And your school? Your exams?","vi":"Còn trường học? Còn thi cử?","ipa":["ənd","jɔɹ","skul","jɔɹ","ɪɡˈzæmz"],"start":41.924,"end":44.594,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,41.924],[1,42.07],[2,42.266],[3,43.687],[4,43.961]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"I'd love to finish school, too. The academy has normal lessons in the morning.","vi":"Con cũng muốn học xong phổ thông. Học viện có giờ học văn hoá vào buổi sáng.","ipa":["aɪd","lʌv","tu","ˈfɪnɪʃ","skul","tu","ðə","əˈkædəmi","hæz","ˈnɔɹməl","ˈlɛsənz","ɪn","ðə","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ"],"start":45.384,"end":49.414,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,45.384],[1,45.491],[2,45.661],[3,45.765],[4,46.064],[5,46.416],[6,47.145],[7,47.223],[8,47.796],[9,48.017],[10,48.473],[11,48.89],[12,48.968],[13,49.046]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"You've thought about this a lot, haven't you?","vi":"Con đã suy nghĩ rất nhiều về chuyện này, phải không?","ipa":["juv","θɔt","əˈbaʊt","ðɪs","ə","lɑt","ˈhævənt","ju"],"start":50.204,"end":52.304,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,50.204],[1,50.37],[2,50.63],[3,50.916],[4,51.112],[5,51.203],[6,51.75],[7,52.075]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"Every day for two years. I'd regret it if I didn't try.","vi":"Ngày nào cũng nghĩ, suốt hai năm nay. Con sẽ hối tiếc nếu không thử.","ipa":["ˈɛvɚi","deɪ","fɔɹ","tu","jɪɹz","aɪd","ɹəˈɡɹɛt","ɪt","ɪf","aɪ","ˈdɪdənt","tɹaɪ"],"start":53.094,"end":56.284,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,53.094],[1,53.276],[2,53.563],[3,53.693],[4,53.941],[5,54.852],[6,54.995],[7,55.373],[8,55.464],[9,55.581],[10,55.646],[11,55.881]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"When I was your age, I wanted to be a singer.","vi":"Hồi bằng tuổi con, bố muốn làm ca sĩ.","ipa":["wɛn","aɪ","wɑz","jɔɹ","eɪdʒ","aɪ","ˈwɔntɪd","tu","bi","ə","ˈsɪŋɚ"],"start":57.074,"end":59.474,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,57.074],[1,57.194],[2,57.312],[3,57.533],[4,57.741],[5,58.236],[6,58.327],[7,58.692],[8,58.783],[9,58.939],[10,59.03]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"Really? You never told me that!","vi":"Thật ạ? Bố chưa bao giờ kể với con!","ipa":["ˈɹɪli","ju","ˈnɛvɚ","toʊld","mi","ðæt"],"start":60.264,"end":61.954,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,60.264],[1,60.954],[2,61.045],[3,61.28],[4,61.514],[5,61.631]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"I never tried. I don't want you to make the same mistake.","vi":"Bố chưa bao giờ thử. Bố không muốn con mắc sai lầm giống bố.","ipa":["aɪ","ˈnɛvɚ","tɹaɪd","aɪ","doʊnt","wɑnt","ju","tu","meɪk","ðə","seɪm","mɪˈsteɪk"],"start":62.744,"end":66.674,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,62.744],[1,62.818],[2,63.196],[3,64.578],[4,64.748],[5,64.982],[6,65.229],[7,65.373],[8,65.464],[9,65.698],[10,65.841],[11,66.115]]},{"speaker":"arun","en":"Does that mean… I can apply?","vi":"Vậy có nghĩa là… con được nộp đơn ạ?","ipa":["dʌz","ðæt","min","aɪ","kæn","əˈplaɪ"],"start":67.464,"end":69.124,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,67.464],[1,67.568],[2,67.764],[3,68.48],[4,68.571],[5,68.688]]},{"speaker":"rao","en":"It means your mother and I want to see your next performance. From the front row.","vi":"Nghĩa là mẹ con và bố muốn xem buổi biểu diễn tới của con. Từ hàng ghế đầu.","ipa":["ɪt","minz","jɔɹ","ˈmʌðɚ","ənd","aɪ","wɑnt","tu","si","jɔɹ","nɛkst","pɚˈfɔɹməns","fɹʌm","ðə","fɹʌnt","ɹoʊ"],"start":69.914,"end":74.924,"expression":"happy"